         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### First steps\n\nOur learning happens from the first moments of life, with new knowledge built upon the previous ones.\n\nLet's look at this in more detail in this lesson.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "163a3e9d-c8b9-4af2-9a29-ded4ba0b16a6",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1
      },
      {
         "id": "163a3e9d-c8b9-4af2-9a29-ded4ba0b16a6",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "ac8121aa-5c0c-47cf-adc8-06a17a05e80a",
               "text": "Original text",
               "page": "index.html?page=class_content&arg=a358881b-26e5-45c8-9d1e-e89a161096c7",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "As babies, we are introduced to toys that give us fun, but they are also the foundation for our future.\n\nLet's look at a toy that has several dolls placed one inside another: the Matryoshka (матрёшка).",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "659691a8-4075-449a-baa2-d6198a72926b",
