               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### The stages\n\nDoctor Francisco A. González Redondo has a proposal that fits perfectly with the Matryoshka (матрёшка) doll.\n\nOur first years at school would be a pre-science phase, in which we get to know some ideas.\n\nIn the second phase of student life, we have a scent, an initial taste, which would be the proto-science phase.\n\nFinally, when we reach college, we come into contact with deeper knowledge and get to know science.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "73823770-faa3-4112-a1eb-928cedcc53d9",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1
      },
      {
         "id": "73823770-faa3-4112-a1eb-928cedcc53d9",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "think",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "cd61bc64-1358-4bfd-b343-3629facaa3b4",
               "text": "González Redondo, Francisco A.",
               "page": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RFui5Z52pUY",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2024",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
