        "source_menu": [],
        "text": [
          {
            "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this lesson, we learned that knowledge is built in layers, like a toy that children play with when they are little.\n\nIn addition, we saw that the knowledge we have since childhood helps us with future knowledge.\n\nIn the next lesson, we will learn how each person learns.",
